      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's pretty intense, thanks. I think that'll definitely give them an edge. Just one more thing—some people say that UBI is actually the only way to save the economy in the long run because it keeps consumer spending up. How would you respond to that? Is there a way to just dismiss that entire concept as economically illiterate?",
